MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Report form auto-detects location (geolocation -> nearest gazetteer place)
  and date/time; GPS-denied falls back to the demo area selector
- Description analysed by DistilBERT-MNLI zero-shot (Xenova/distilbert-base-
  uncased-mnli, q8): event type + severity distribution -> text score
  (ensemble with the domain lexicon; safety floors for critical keywords)
- Photo analysed by YOLO (Xenova/yolos-tiny, q8): vehicle/person/heavy counts
  -> scene score; final = max(text, photo x 0.8) so photos escalate but never
  downgrade, and 'critical' stays description-only
- Result screen shows the full AI breakdown (BERT read, YOLO objects,
  combined score, alert radius); verdicts persisted in SocialPost.nlpMeta.ai
- Models run via transformers.js + onnxruntime-node (serverExternalPackages),
  cached in .models/ (gitignored), globalThis singletons to survive HMR
- citizen reports skip the LLM classify pass (noLlm) since BERT covers it
- README: 'Citizen reports' section with the pipeline diagram
